==English==
{{wikipedia|dialectic}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{m|grc|διαλεκτική||the art of argument through interactive questioning and answering}}, from {{m|grc|διαλεκτικός||competent debater}}, from {{m|grc|διαλέγομαι||to participate in a [[dialogue]]}}, from {{m|grc|διά||inter, through}} + {{m|grc|λέγειν||to speak}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun|-}}

# A [[systematic]] method of [[argument]] that attempts to [[resolve]] the [[contradiction]]s in [[opposing]] [[view]]s or [[idea]]s.

=====Synonyms=====
* {{l|en|dialectic}}
* {{l|en|dialectical method}}

